Hi {Owner},

I build websites for videographers around {City}. {Business Name} makes beautiful films, but there's no site where a couple can see packages and check a date, or where a listing agent can book a walkthrough.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: wedding film packages, a vows audio section, a date check, and a separate real estate and drone video page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go and marked film slots. I never use anyone's work without written permission:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, new films and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes on a weekday?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
